        "title": "bug: Show the workflow_dispatch inputs on the run page",
        "body": "### Can you reproduce the bug on the Forgejo test instance?\n\nNo, I can't try it on the test instance for some reason\n\n### Description\n\n1. I have an E2E testing workflow triggered by workflow_dispatch, with a few inputs to fill in.\r\n2. After the run, the run page doesn't show which inputs it was started with.\r\n3. That makes debugging hard, and I can't copy the same inputs into the next run on a newer commit.\r\n\r\n\r\nExpected: the run page lists the workflow dispatch inputs, e.g. next to the trigger and commit in the header or anywhere on the page to see it clearly...\n\n### Screenshots\n\nsee bellow\n\n### Forgejo Version\n\nVersion: 16.0.5, self-hosted\n\n### Browser Version\n\nChrome, Version 154.0.8037.98 (Official Build) (arm64)\n\n",
