        "title": "bug: teams setting permission description for PRs is unclear",
        "body": "### Can you reproduce the bug on the Forgejo test instance?\n\nNo, I've tried it and the problem is not present there\n\n### Description\n\n1. create a team\n2. set permissions: Code - no access, Issues - write, Pull requests - READ\n\nWhat.I noticed strange that Pull Request has a description saying: \"Read: Reading and create pull requests.\".\n\nSo I was thinking how it's even possible to create a PR without access into a code. Hopefully it's not, button is disabled, but that description makes me wonder. \n\nCan we do a condition description based on what I check in \"code\" section?\n\n### Screenshots\n\nbellow\n\n### Forgejo Version\n\n16.0.5\n\n### Browser Version\n\nChrome Version 154.0.8037.98 (Official Build) (arm64)\n\n",
